{
  "_meta": {
    "source": "oldschool.runescape.wiki, one page per pet, read as raw wikitext",
    "read": "2026-09-02",
    "formula": "Eight of the nine skilling pets roll 1 / (base - level * 25), where level is the player's base level in the pet's skill and stops helping at 99. Herbi is flat. levelScaled says which.",
    "approximation": "Chronicle knows the level held now, not the level each attempt was made at. Applying today's level to yesterday's work prices early attempts better than they were, so every level-scaled figure reads a little dry. Said on the page, not only here.",
    "unlisted": "A source the wiki prints as Unknown, or that no counter can name in the unit the roll is asked in, is absent. Absence is deliberate everywhere; each pet's _excluded says what and why.",
    "notImplemented": "The 200,000,000 xp fifteen-fold bonus. No account here is near it and the wiki gives no worked denominators for it."
  },
